    "Post-processing did not finish. The speaker-labelled transcript is unaffected." : {"localizations":{"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Die Nachbearbeitung wurde nicht abgeschlossen. Das Transkript mit Sprecherzuordnung bleibt unverändert."}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Post-processing did not finish. The speaker-labelled transcript is unaffected."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"El postprocesamiento no terminó. La transcripción con hablantes etiquetados no cambia."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Le post-traitement ne s’est pas terminé. La transcription avec locuteurs identifiés est inchangée."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"La post-elaborazione non è stata completata. La trascrizione con i parlanti etichettati resta invariata."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"後処理が完了しませんでした。話者ラベル付きの文字起こしはそのままです。"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"후처리가 끝나지 않았습니다. 화자 레이블이 붙은 전사문은 그대로입니다."}},"pt":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"O pós-processamento não terminou. A transcrição com falantes identificados permanece inalterada."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Постобработка не завершилась. Расшифровка с обозначением говорящих не изменилась."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"后处理未完成。已标注说话人的转录文本未受影响。"}}}},
